 SG_ IntegrityStatus : 8|8@1+ (1,0) [0|3] "" DIAG
 SG_ GatewayIntegrity : 16|8@1+ (1,0) [0|3] "" DIAG

BO_ 265 AUXILIARY_POWER: 8 BMS
